          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Patterns are selected by HI laundering lift. Review distinct final transactions matching the selected patterns. Each transfer occurs later and within 24 hours of the previous transfer, linking its receiving bank/account to the next transfer’s sending bank/account</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
