          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Expanding from top 5 to top 10 raises laundering catch rate from 19.95% to 21.29%, while legitimate review increases from 2.16% to 7.55%. This shows the additional review workload required for a modest gain in coverage. Counts use distinct final transactions.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
